   "text": "Order is the point. The error handler is registered after the hooks so it catches their failures. Static files are imported lazily — a top-level import there is exactly what caused the outage in frame 09.",
   "originalText": "Order is the point. The error handler is registered after the hooks so it catches their failures. Static files are imported lazily — a top-level import there is exactly what caused the outage in frame 09.",
