   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "db/postgres/schema.sql calls itself \"the production system of record\" and carries rules the boot migrations do not, including CHECK (length(title) >= 4).\nNothing applies it automatically: migrations come from db/migrations/pg at boot, and CI never runs schema.sql. The same title rule is enforced in code\ninstead — zod .min(4) and a 4-character guard in the service.",
   "originalText": "db/postgres/schema.sql calls itself \"the production system of record\" and carries rules the boot migrations do not, including CHECK (length(title) >= 4).\nNothing applies it automatically: migrations come from db/migrations/pg at boot, and CI never runs schema.sql. The same title rule is enforced in code\ninstead — zod .min(4) and a 4-character guard in the service.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
