   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "81 tables are alive today, created by 83 CREATE TABLE statements — the two extra are rebuild-and-rename artefacts from the SQLite era (sessions_new, sla_timers_new), not leftovers. And the drift above is real: the code is the arbiter, so the rule that matters is\nthe one in routes/index.ts:392 and services/tasks.ts:99.",
   "originalText": "81 tables are alive today, created by 83 CREATE TABLE statements — the two extra are rebuild-and-rename artefacts from the SQLite era (sessions_new, sla_timers_new), not leftovers. And the drift above is real: the code is the arbiter, so the rule that matters is\nthe one in routes/index.ts:392 and services/tasks.ts:99.",
