   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every failure that actually happened became three things: a comment in the file explaining why, a test that reproduces it,\nand a line in the documentation. That is why the repository has an opinion about /tmp and about top-level imports.",
   "originalText": "Every failure that actually happened became three things: a comment in the file explaining why, a test that reproduces it,\nand a line in the documentation. That is why the repository has an opinion about /tmp and about top-level imports.",
