   "updated": 1762000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "project_members, partner_iam_users and client_portal_users all exist, and scope.ts can restrict a query by membership. With a single admin operator the scope resolves\nto \"everything\", so the restriction never fires. Saying it enforces access control would be false; saying it is absent would also be false. It is present and idle.",
   "originalText": "project_members, partner_iam_users and client_portal_users all exist, and scope.ts can restrict a query by membership. With a single admin operator the scope resolves\nto \"everything\", so the restriction never fires. Saying it enforces access control would be false; saying it is absent would also be false. It is present and idle.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
