   "locked": false,
   "text": "A build can pass while the server never starts: a missing setting, a bad top-level import, a port that is not bound. So the\npipeline builds the way production builds, then starts the artefact and calls it.",
   "originalText": "A build can pass while the server never starts: a missing setting, a bad top-level import, a port that is not bound. So the\npipeline builds the way production builds, then starts the artefact and calls it.",
